# Applies when jejune_cli hands this repository to `docker build` as the named
# context pdf-to-markdown (--local-pdf-to-markdown): keeps host-only content out.
# .git is deliberately kept: setuptools-scm derives the version (git commit
# included) from it when the image is built. For the same reason NO file tracked
# by git may be excluded here (e.g. .vscode/): a tracked file missing from the copy
# makes setuptools-scm report a dirty tree, hence a version ending with .d<date>.
.claude
.venv
**/__pycache__
.pytest_cache
.coverage
build
*.egg-info
